{
  "name": "色觉助手 Color Vision Helper",
  "short_name": "色觉助手",
  "description": "实时识别颜色、分割色块，并为色弱/色盲用户实时矫正视频颜色。Name colors, outline color regions and correct colors live for color-vision deficiency.",
